/images/dw/20260202/1094968497467035648037154.jpeg/bHNw1pyNGKJCgjcZgvcFDxG-VDnNwMeQ4wC1u-MAtbs\"/><figcaption>melody殷悅（Instagram@melodykliu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"melody殷悅（Instagram@melodykliu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260202/1094968500168298496435127.jpeg/bWt66rif3_R1mUDnm5wJE6tLu7ApWF4Y2vyQ09r8kNM\"/><figcaption>melody殷悅（Instagram@melodykliu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"melody殷悅（Instagram@melodykliu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260202/1094968502374633472732469.jpeg/Qb2yAc271HrSWLe5ftCLyTof4sI1SeoYIVJ3ZCFSd2Q\"/><figcaption>melody殷悅（Instagram@melodykliu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"melody殷悅（Instagram@melodykliu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260202/1094968499341627392510726.jpeg/S_Ux3AQkk3wXkHnAtCtrorwNa0xRavG4ldWOupXVjro\"/><figcaption>melody殷悅（Instagram@melodykliu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"melody殷悅（Instagram@melodykliu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260202/1094968501799620608504917.jpeg/zCz7HCjwmmDClc5U6t0F7OqDOMDsc5FkUU8SoVFPEqE\"/><figcaption>melody殷悅（Instagram@melodykliu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"melody殷悅（Instagram@melodykliu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260202/1094968503989178368745986.jpeg/_OZ5AiSahc-hpGdmnzLW1n1xNUQEq8Xs8C3sm_At7Js\"/><figcaption>melody殷悅（Instagram@melodykliu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"melody殷悅（Instagram@melodykliu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260202/1094968506438782976508934.jpeg/Foi_HB70GHPAd8hMISugx3svT6fFFk46B6Et6gehLeo\"/><figcaption>melody殷悅（Instagram@melodykliu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"melody殷悅（Instagram@melodykliu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260202/1094968508674478080172934.jpeg/SOOLpp-4aB4hhHS8oz7wBts3owwJ0e1yfMClNnzApTY\"/><figcaption>melody殷悅（Instagram@melodykliu）</figcaption></figure><p>【本文獲《聯合早報》授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T07:42:55.835262+00:00","quality